	)
	(text_box "RESET_B (P1_29, reset function by default): 10 kOhm up + 10 nF; the pad's own pull is only the ~1 MOhm high-resistance\noption (Table 11). ISPMODE_N (P3_29) is sampled at reset: 10 kOhm up = normal boot from flash. J501: Tag-Connect TC2030-NL\npads, separate from the main's J401 (no debug path joins the controllers, §B2.5)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 626.47 31.75 0)
		(size 140 8.477)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
