		)
		(uuid "3298f4ae-b943-52ce-81a8-167c7f862eea")
	)
	(text_box "LINK_M2S: 100 kOhm to GND (an unpowered main reads as a continuous break) + 1 kOhm series + SN74LVC1G17 Schmitt (contract 5.3). OVP_TRIP: its default resistor (100 kOhm to GND) is on sheet 11; it enters U501 only\nthrough U503, no pull here. With 3V3_SUP off, both buffers' inputs and outputs are high-impedance (Ioff <= 10 uA), so the main domain cannot feed 3V3_SUP through U501's pin diodes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.72 83.437 0)
		(size 244.905 6.318)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
